SC,0002
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 368 Wed 25 NovC02:25/00
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5 
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings  
OL,4,Cwith Man City released                 
OL,6,FIt comes as Burnham told MPs that "all 
OL,7,Fof my dealings" with Manchester City's 
OL,8,Fowners would be published.             
OL,10,FA Greater Manchester Combined          
OL,11,FAuthority spokesman said: "In October  
OL,12,F2021 Andy Burnham, in his role as      
OL,13,Fmayor of Greater Manchester, had a     
OL,14,Fformal meeting with Khaldoon Al        
OL,15,FMubarak at the UK Government's Global  
OL,16,FInvestment Summit arranged by the      
OL,17,FDepartment for International Trade.    
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,369,390,250,120,0,100
PN,36803
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 368 Wed 25 NovC02:25/00
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5 
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings  
OL,4,Cwith Man City released                 
OL,6,F"In his capacity as mayor, he was a    
OL,7,Fguest of Manchester City FC at home    
OL,8,Fmatches on a small number of           
OL,9,Foccasions, including attending Vincent 
OL,10,FKompany's testimonial match in         
OL,11,FSeptember 2019, where he met the       
OL,12,Fchairman informally in the stands.     
OL,13,FThese have been declared in the usual  
OL,14,Fway.                                   
OL,16,F"Also during his time as mayor,        
OL,17,Frepresentatives of Greater Manchester  
OL,18,Fsporting clubs would routinely join    
OL,19,Fbusiness delegations as part of        
OL,20,Fmayoral international visits.          
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,369,390,250,120,0,100
PN,36804
SC,0004
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 368 Wed 25 NovC02:25/00
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5 
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings  
OL,4,Cwith Man City released                 
OL,6,F"This included representatives from    
OL,7,FManchester United travelling to Austin 
OL,8,Fand Dublin, Lancashire Cricket Club    
OL,9,Fjoining a delegation to India, and     
OL,10,FManchester City FC staff supporting    
OL,11,Fvisits to China and Japan."            
OL,13,FCity have been found guilty of         
OL,14,Fbreaching Premier League financial     
OL,15,Fregulations between 2009 and 2018.     
OL,17,FThe club maintained their innocence    
OL,18,Fand appealed against the verdict.      
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,369,390,250,120,0,100
PN,36805
SC,0005
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 368 Wed 25 NovC02:25/00
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5 
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings  
OL,4,Cwith Man City released                 
OL,6,FBurnham said in September he would be  
OL,7,F"really concerned" if City's Abu Dhabi 
OL,8,Fowners sold the club in the wake of    
OL,9,Fthe finding, crediting them with being 
OL,10,F"a huge partner in the building of     
OL,11,Fmodern Manchester".                    
OL,13,FDowning Street sought to clarify his   
OL,14,Fcomments afterwards, saying the prime  
OL,15,Fminister was clear the judgment is     
OL,16,Fserious and that where wrongdoing is   
OL,17,Festablished, those responsible should  
OL,18,Fface the consequences.                 
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
